{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Playwright-style auto-waiting interaction: waits for the target to be attached, visible, enabled (and bounding-box stable for click/check/uncheck), then dispatches in the same synchronous task. Actions: click, fill (native setter, React-safe), type (per-char key events), press (Enter/Tab/Escape/arrows; Enter requestSubmits), select (by value/label/text), check, uncheck. Selector engine beyond CSS: text=, css=, :visible, :nth-match(n), and >> chaining (e.g. \"form >> text=Save\"). arg carries the value for fill/type, the key for press, the option for select; pass \"\" when unused. timeout_ms<=0 defaults to 10000. Returns {status, action, selector, desc, bbox, attempts, elapsed_ms, selected?/typed?/already?} or {status:err, msg, state(absent|hidden|disabled|stabilizing|no-option)}.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"desc":"Interaction to perform: click, fill, type, press, select, check, uncheck.","name":"action","type":"String"},{"desc":"Target selector. CSS, or text=... / css=..., with optional :visible and :nth-match(n) suffixes; chain segments with >> (e.g. \"form >> text=Save\").","name":"selector","type":"String"},{"desc":"Action argument: value for fill/type, key for press (Enter, Tab, Escape, Backspace, arrows, single chars), value/label/text for select. Pass \"\" when the action needs none (click, check, uncheck).","name":"arg","type":"String"},{"desc":"Total actionability-wait budget in ms; <=0 defaults to 10000.","name":"timeout_ms","type":"Integer"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"mqgnnp1a10bcf38a1j18d","readers":[],"time":1791199527112,"username":"system","writers":[]}